o editing, 3D and gaming\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Nimbus 13\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Everything you need, for less\",\n    \"price\": 999,\n    \"weightKg\": 1,\n    \"batteryH\": 22,\n    \"screen\": \"13\\\" IPS\",\n    \"cpu\": \"6-core, 15 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 16,\n    \"storageGb\": 256,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"headphone\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.2,\n    \"reviews\": 2310,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Lightest\",\n      \"Best battery life\",\n      \"Lowest price\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Dimmer screen\",\n      \"Small SSD\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Students and light office work\"\n  }\n]","systemHash":"dcc43620444bd5561aa7a57e09f50adaace10b9cc1a0c5f2f824f41f6ed0f15b","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Laptop comparison</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Three machines, one decision. Compare specs, strengths and trade-offs side by side — then jump to the recommendation that matches how you work.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">Updated Oct 2026</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">3 models · 5,110 reviews combined</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Best overall balance</span>\n          <span class=\"up\">★ 4.6</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0\">Aero 14</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:0\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:baseline\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">$1,299</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">1,840 reviews</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Best for: travel and everyday work</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Most powerful</span>\n          <span class=\"up\">★ 4.4</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0\">Forge 16</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:0\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:baseline\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">960 reviews</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Best for: video editing, 3D and gaming</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Best value</span>\n          <span class=\"up\">★ 4.2</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0\">Nimbus 13</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin:0\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:baseline\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">$999</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">2,310 reviews</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Best for: students and light office work</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Head-to-head numbers</div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Price (USD)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div>\n        <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div>\n        <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight (kg) — lower is better\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1.0}]}'></div>\n        <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"User rating (out of 5)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":4.6},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":4.4},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":4.2}]}'></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Nimbus 13 is 47% cheaper than Forge 16, runs up to 2.4× longer on battery, and is the lightest of the three — while Forge 16 delivers double the CPU cores at more than double the weight.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Full spec table</div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">Best value in each row is highlighted.</p>\n      <div style=\"overflow-x:auto\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>Spec</th><th>Aero 14</th><th>Forge 16</th><th>Nimbus 13</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"specTable\">\n            <tr><td>Price</td><td class=\"num\">$1,299</td><td class=\"num\">$1,899</td><td class=\"num\">$999</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Weight</td><td class=\"num\">1.2 kg</td><td class=\"num\">2.1 kg</td><td class=\"num\">1.0 kg</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Battery life</td><td class=\"num\">18 h</td><td class=\"num\">9 h</td><td class=\"num\">22 h</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Screen</td><td>14\" OLED</td><td>16\" IPS 165Hz</td><td>13\" IPS</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>CPU</td><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td>16-core, 55 W</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>RAM</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td><td class=\"num\">32 GB</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">512 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1024 GB</td><td class=\"num\">256 GB</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Ports</td><td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone</td><td>2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card</td><td>2x USB-C, headphone</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Rating</td><td class=\"num\">★ 4.6 (1,840)</td><td class=\"num\">★ 4.4 (960)</td><td class=\"num\">★ 4.2 (2,310)</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Aero 14</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">The all-rounder</p>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"small\"><strong>Pros</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"badge\">Gorgeous OLED panel</span><span class=\"badge\">Great battery</span><span class=\"badge\">Quiet under load</span></div>\n          <div class=\"small\"><strong>Cons</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Soldered RAM</span><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Glossy screen</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Forge 16</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">The powerhouse</p>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"small\"><strong>Pros</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"badge\">Fastest of the three</span><span class=\"badge\">Upgradeable RAM and SSD</span><span class=\"badge\">Full port selection</span></div>\n          <div class=\"small\"><strong>Cons</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Heavy</span><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Fans are audible</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Nimbus 13</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:0\">The budget pick</p>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"small\"><strong>Pros</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"badge\">Lightest</span><span class=\"badge\">Best battery life</span><span class=\"badge\">Lowest price</span></div>\n          <div class=\"small\"><strong>Cons</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Dimmer screen</span><span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Small SSD</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Which one should you pick?</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" id=\"picker\">\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"use\" value=\"travel\" checked> I travel a lot and need all-day battery</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"use\" value=\"power\"> I edit video, work in 3D or game</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"use\" value=\"budget\"> I want the cheapest capable machine</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"use\" value=\"ports\"> I need lots of ports and upgradeability</label>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <div id=\"pickResult\" class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Our pick for you</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\" id=\"pickBadge\">Aero 14</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"pickWhy\" style=\"margin:0\">For travel and everyday work, the Aero 14 hits the sweet spot: a 1.2 kg body, 18-hour battery and a gorgeous OLED panel. If you can give up the nicer screen, the Nimbus 13 saves you $300 and lasts even longer.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"alert\">\n      <strong>Quick verdict.</strong> If money is the constraint, get the Nimbus 13 — it's $300–$900 cheaper and outlasts both on battery. If raw performance is the constraint, the Forge 16 is the only one that can handle heavy editing and gaming. Everyone else should default to the Aero 14.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  #specTable td.best { font-weight: 600; }\n  #picker input { margin-right: 0.5rem; }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  // Highlight the best cell per comparable row\n  var best = {\n    'Price': 2,        // Nimbus cheapest\n    'Weight': 2,       // Nimbus lightest\n    'Battery life': 2, // Nimbus longest\n    'RAM': 1,          // Forge most\n    'Storage': 1,      // Forge most\n    'Rating': 0        // Aero highest\n  };\n  var rows = document.querySelectorAll('#specTable tr');\n  rows.forEach(function (tr) {\n    var spec = tr.cells[0].textContent.trim();\n    if (best.hasOwnProperty(spec)) tr.cells[best[spec] + 1].classList.add('best');\n  });\n\n  // Recommendation picker\n  var picks = {\n    travel: ['Aero 14', 'For travel and everyday work, the Aero 14 hits the sweet spot: a 1.2 kg body, 18-hour battery and a gorgeous OLED panel. If you can give up the nicer screen, the Nimbus 13 saves you $300 and lasts even longer.'],\n    power: ['Forge 16', 'The Forge 16 is the only machine here built for heavy work: a 16-core 55 W CPU, 32 GB RAM, a 1 TB SSD and a 165Hz 16\" panel. The trade-off is 2.1 kg and audible fans under load.'],\n    budget: ['Nimbus 13', 'At $999 the Nimbus 13 is the lowest price and lowest weight of the three, with a class-leading 22-hour battery. The 256 GB SSD is its weak spot — budget for external storage.'],\n    ports: ['Forge 16', 'The Forge 16 is the clear choice: 2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet and an SD card slot, plus upgradeable RAM and SSD so it grows with you.']\n  };\n  document.querySelectorAll('#picker input[name=\"use\"]').forEach(function (input) {\n    input.addEventListener('change', function () {\n      var pick = picks[input.value];\n      document.getElementById('pickBadge').textContent = pick[0];\n      document.getElementById('pickWhy').textContent = pick[1];\n    });\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[3145,"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Laptop comparison<